<title>SPAIN: Spain had 168.8 billion pesetas Jan c/a surplus.</title>
<headline>Spain had 168.8 billion pesetas Jan c/a surplus.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following figures (in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> BALANCE OF PAYMENTS		JAN 97    DEC 97     JAN  96</p>
<p>  C/A balance			 168.8     -98.9	104.8</p>
<p>  Trade balance		     -61.3     -96.4     -126.3</p>
<p>  Services			    154.1     126.6	157.7</p>
<p>  Net tourism receipts	    195.2     175.7	173.8</p>
<p>  Other services		    -41.1     -49.1	-16.0</p>
<p>  Dividend income		   -63.3     -93.4	-33.5</p>
<p>  Transfers			   139.4     -35.8	106.9</p>
</text>
